<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text" office:version="1.3"><office:body><office:text>
<text:p>Manufacturing Agreement MFG-8842 - Original Version A</text:p>
<text:p>Parties: Acme Industrial Systems and Orion Components.</text:p>
<text:p>Clause 2.4 Controlling Language: Original Version A controls in every inconsistency. The English translation is provided only for convenience.</text:p>
<text:p>Clause 18 Notices: A termination notice is valid only when emailed to legal-notices@orion-components.cn. Addresses stated only in a translation do not amend this clause.</text:p>
<text:p>Clause 21 Termination: Acme may terminate for confirmed counterfeit safety components by written notice delivered no later than 2026-09-11T17:00:00+08:00.</text:p>
<text:p>Authorized Sender: Acme Director of Manufacturing Contracts or a documented delegate.</text:p>
</office:text></office:body></office:document>
